WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:05.122
We will start by asking why a workload might need distributed processing.

00:00:05.122 --> 00:00:10.292
Then we will introduce the Spark execution model.

00:00:10.292 --> 00:00:16.302
After that, we will connect S Q L and data frames, discuss lakehouse and Delta concepts,

00:00:16.302 --> 00:00:19.356
and practice familiar S Q L patterns.

00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:27.813
The last part of the module focuses on query plans, partitions, shuffles, and project-style reasoning.
